   "status": "MISMATCH",
   "ruling": "Ruling: ambiguity; amb.2025.sa_medical_negative_agi: the project floors adjusted gross income at zero for the 7.5% medical limit (a negative line 2 would raise line 4 above the expenses), the recorded reading; same ruling as the earlier rounds. f1040sa line 2, 'Enter amount from Form 1040 or 1040-SR, line 11b'.",
