   "ruling": "Ruling: scope; refusal located elsewhere. i1040sca, Line 6, 'Include on this line income taxes you paid to a foreign country and generation-skipping tax (GST) imposed on certain income distributions.' The foreign tax deduction is refused by sa.foreign_tax_deduct. The GST deduction (section 164(a)(4)) is for tax on income distributions from a trust, which reach the beneficiary on a Schedule K-1 (Form 1041), refused by scope.k1. Same ruling as the earlier round.",
