   "ruling": "Ruling: scope; i1040sca p. 11, Line 15, 'Complete and attach Form 4684 to figure the amount of your loss'. A casualty or theft is refused before Schedule A: sd.casualty (asked of every filer) feeds sd.other_forms, refused on sd.count, so line 15 is $0 on every computed return. Same ruling as the earlier rounds.",
