   "ruling": "Ruling: scope; i1040sca p. 11, Line 16 list. The gambling limit matches, as the model says. Casualty and theft losses of income-producing property (Form 4684 lines 32 and 38b, Form 4797 line 18a) and a net qualified disaster loss (Form 4684 line 15) are refused through sd.casualty and sd.business_property into sd.other_forms; the claim-of-right repayment over $3,000 by s3.repaid_income (Schedule 3 and scope refusals); the other listed items by sa.unsupported. Same ruling as the earlier rounds.",
